    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Forgetting About Gzip/Brotli Compression:</strong> While Base64 inflates uncompressed file size, server-level Gzip and Brotli compression can compress repetitive ASCII character sequences by 15% to 25%. Always enable text compression on your server.
    </li>
    <li>
